      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Multilingual dubbing\n\n1. Load a speech clip in **Speech to dub**.\n2. **Seed ASR** transcribes it.\n3. **BytePlus LLM** translates it. The target language is in the LLM's *system_prompt* (default Japanese); change it there.\n4. **Seed TTS** speaks the translation. Pick a voice for that language in *Dub*.\n\nNeeds ModelArk and Seed Speech keys in Settings > BytePlus."
      ],
